# Dependencies
**/node_modules
**/.pnp
**/.pnp.js

# Build outputs and caches (rebuilt inside the container)
**/dist
**/build
**/coverage
**/.turbo
**/*.tsbuildinfo

# Local env files
**/.env
**/.env*.local

# Tests and examples are not needed to build the images
**/tests
**/examples

# Debug logs
**/npm-debug.log*
**/yarn-debug.log*
**/.pnpm-debug.log*

# Misc
**/.DS_Store
**/*.pem
.git
.gitattributes

# Docker
**/.dockerignore
**/Dockerfile
**/docker-compose.yml

# CI/CD
**/.github

# Docs
**/*.md
